<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi's Amiantit Co Q1 net profit surges.</title>
<headline>Saudi's Amiantit Co Q1 net profit surges.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit		  7.5   vs     1.6</p>
<p> Operating income	106.9   vs    80.3</p>
<p> Operating cost	   89.4   vs    69.7</p>
<p> Net operating income   17.5   vs    10.6</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds   372.1   vs   362.1</p>
<p> Assets		    946.5   vs 1,026.4</p>
<p>Full Name: Saudi Arabian Amiantit Company.</p>
<p>Note - Based in Dammam, the company is traded on the Saudi stock market.</p>
<p>-- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424</p>
</text>
